title: Suno AI Automation Skill for AI Agents
message: "If you use this skill or its DOM research, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shramko
    given-names: Andrii
    email: zmei116@gmail.com
    orcid: ""
repository-code: "https://github.com/AndriiShramko/suno-ai-agent-automation-skill"
abstract: >-
  A verified DOM map and JavaScript helper library that lets an AI agent
  (Claude Code, Cursor, or any LLM able to run JavaScript in a browser tab)
  operate the Suno AI web application end to end — filling lyrics, style,
  exclude-styles, title and duration, submitting a generation, and verifying
  it started — without screenshots, computer vision, coordinate clicking, or a
  paid API. Documents working techniques for Lexical contenteditable editors,
  React-controlled inputs, React prop invocation on buttons, ARIA sliders, and
  hidden-tab limitations.
